# One-off permission-repair run: a filesystem census plus per-owner scripts
# generated from it. Hardcodes this deployment's uids and paths, goes stale as
# soon as anyone re-saves a file, and this repo is public. The reusable half is
# the group-laundering technique (create a fresh inode inside a setgid dir when
# the NFS server refuses a client-side chgrp) -- that belongs in
# embryodb/permissions.py, not here.
permission_fix_fulldb/
